cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
server.1	1	void-os	void-os			true	false	the server speaks MCP over stdio, reading standard input and writing standard output until standard input ends
server.2	1	void-os	void-os			true	false	server/discover answers with the server's name, version and instructions, the data bank's folder filled in
server.3	1	void-os	void-os			true	false	the server offers one tool, named and described by the Values, its input pathname, required, and five optional strings
server.6	1	void-os	void-os			true	false	arguments not given are handed to read as the empty text: the whole file read
server.4	1	void-os	void-os			true	false	the tool's result is one text content holding the reply
server.5	1	void-os	void-os			true	false	a call refused is reported as a tool execution error whose text is the reason
environment
requirement	case	name	value
server.2	1	VOID_OS_DATA_BANK	$PWD/bank
