server.3	1	1	/result/tools/0/description	string	Read a file, a directory of files, or the data bank, as MTSV text: a tab between fields, a line break between records, a form feed before each sheet's name. Every reply begins with the report; then the field names of each sheet, or, with a selection, its values.
